{"id":16,"text":"Two frogs lived near a farm. One night, they were looking for food. They fell into a big bucket of milk.\n\nThe milk was deep, and the walls were high. They could not jump out.\n\nThe first frog said, “This is the end. We can’t escape. I am tired.” He stopped swimming and sank down.\n\nThe second frog was also afraid. But he said, “I will not stop. I will keep trying.” He kicked his legs and swam all night.\n\nHours passed. His legs were very tired, but he did not give up. Kick, kick, kick.\n\nSlowly, the milk became thick. It turned into butter! The frog stood on the butter. He jumped out of the bucket.\n\nIn the morning, he was safe in the grass. He looked back and thought about his friend.\n\n“If he had kept trying, we both would be here,” he said sadly.\n\nMoral: Never give up, even when things look hopeless.","tr":null,"gl":{"two":"ikki","frogs":"qurbaqalar","lived":"yashardi","near":"yaqinida","a":"bir (noaniq artikl)","farm":"ferma","one":"bir, bitta","night":"tun, kecha","they":"ular","were":"edi(lar)","looking":"qarab","for":"uchun; davomida","food":"ovqat","fell":"yiqildi, tushdi","into":"ichiga","big":"katta","bucket":"chelak","of":"-ning; -dan","milk":"sut","the":"(aniq artikl)","was":"edi","deep":"chuqur","and":"va","walls":"devorlar","high":"baland","could":"qila olardi","not":"emas","jump":"sakramoq","out":"tashqariga","first":"birinchi; avval","frog":"qurbaqa","said":"dedi","this":"bu","is":"-dir (to be)","end":"oxir","we":"biz","can't":"qila olmaydi","escape":"qochmoq","i":"men","am":"-man (to be)","tired":"charchagan","he":"u (erkak)","stopped":"to'xtadi","swimming":"suzish","sank":"cho'kdi","down":"pastga","second":"ikkinchi","also":"ham","afraid":"qo'rqqan","but":"lekin, ammo","will":"-adi (kelasi zamon)","stop":"to'xtatmoq","keep":"davom ettirmoq, saqlamoq","trying":"harakat qilib","kicked":"tepdi","his":"uning","legs":"oyoqlar","swam":"suzdi","all":"hamma, barcha","hours":"soatlar","passed":"o'tdi","very":"juda","did":"qildi","